  "title": "MMDBR: Don't pretend to be a multithreaded writer",
  "description": "Passing a pipe handle as a parameter to the writer thread suggests that\nmultiple write threads could be started. This is not the case. Revert to\nusing the global pipe related variables, just as the reader thread does.",
